Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.49,0:00:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Previously on JoJo's Bizarre\NAdventure... Ka. Choo! Aim. Beware!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.03,0:00:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh. Him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.87,0:00:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.29,0:00:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lloyd.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.45,0:00:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.95,0:00:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.85,0:00:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, where is Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's with Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I get some ice cream, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, ice cream is pretty good, but\Nthis baby here, chilled coconut juice,?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.21,0:00:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing in the world like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.13,0:00:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we can try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, then. Thank you much!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.41,0:00:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's $12!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.83,0:00:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.81,0:00:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it six!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.59,0:00:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.51,0:00:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.63,0:00:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks! Enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.45,0:00:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take that!
