Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.53,0:01:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let you get away with\Nsomething like that! Now can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.07,0:01:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.37,0:01:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.29,0:01:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing to this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.49,0:01:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll kill the bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.81,0:02:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on! Tell me! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.95,0:02:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.07,0:02:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now cut it out damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.91,0:02:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're losing control.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.19,0:02:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're acting like such a bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.61,0:02:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.17,0:02:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.45,0:02:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurt, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.25,0:02:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to shove me around\Nlike you're the one in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.57,0:02:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man tried to steal my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was committing a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.29,0:02:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And criminals should be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, am I wrong, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.81,0:02:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd do the same, old pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.99,0:02:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.85,0:03:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.55,0:03:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.27,0:04:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you glaring at?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.48,0:04:21.61,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,475)\pos(192,820)}Episode 9: Yellow Temperance
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, the look in your eyes\Nis awfully hostile, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.11,0:04:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.65,0:04:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't possibly be\Nthinking about ending our
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.07,0:04:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,friendship over a little\Ntussle with a thief now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.61,0:04:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.53,0:04:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're acting as if I've\Ndone something unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.49,0:04:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow! I see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.45,0:04:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's four of them up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.41,0:04:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making way too\Nbig a deal out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.15,0:05:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just having a bad day. No big thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.05,0:05:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so exhausted from the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.23,0:05:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's put me in such a bad mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.67,0:05:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a bad mood, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.01,0:05:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seemed to me you felt pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.51,0:05:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old man in Avdol think it's a good\Nidea for us to head to India by train.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.73,0:05:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We leave tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take the cable car to\NSingapore Station to reserve tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.83,0:05:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.99,0:05:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakaoing, Jojo's left already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we get going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.31,0:05:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up in just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you must like coconut\Njuice a whole lot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that a beetle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.67,0:06:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, I must be seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.97,0:06:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have been a piece\Nof coconut or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.35,0:06:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do love coconuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Half-Pint?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.75,0:06:30.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.99,0:06:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.11,0:06:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gonna eat that cherry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.35,0:06:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not, then hand it over already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.07,0:06:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, better watch out, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.03,0:06:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.27,0:06:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.15,0:07:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only playing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.31,0:07:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good old Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.81,0:07:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he's a totally different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.97,0:07:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That look again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.85,0:07:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all this hardcore\Nglaring Jotaro, old pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your sense of humor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get in, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.59,0:07:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cable car just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.19,0:07:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I told you to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.47,0:07:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I've got your ticket right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.37,0:07:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna knock your crooked possessed\Nass right into that cable car.
