Dialogue: 2,0:07:55.20,0:07:55.24,SFXYellow4,4,0,0,0,,{=14}{\bord0\blur0.6\frz357.7\pos(729.9,789.76)\4a&HFF&}Wham
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.21,0:07:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.11,0:08:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a bit off. Possessed isn't quite\Nthe word. Want to give it another try?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.63,0:08:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.53,0:08:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congrats on not being\Nas stupid as you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.95,0:08:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though you still haven't realized my body's\Nbeen growing this whole time, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.31,0:08:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.51,0:08:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he a stand? Can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.51,0:08:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was able to touch him just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.61,0:08:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless he's a stand I can\Nstrike with my own fists?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.97,0:08:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can merge with any\Norganic matter I consume.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.03,0:08:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a stand anyone can see and touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.55,0:08:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky them, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.65,0:08:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm yellow temperance\Nof the temperance car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.39,0:08:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gaze upon my handsome face with envy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now, Jotaro old pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.33,0:08:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a good look at your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.49,0:08:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that little bit of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.85,0:09:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It latched on when you hit me and\Nreally doesn't want to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.69,0:09:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I advise you not to touch, or\Nit'll go after your left hand too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.37,0:09:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should save your left\Nhand for picking your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stand is a slow eater, and the\Nmore it eats, the bigger it gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.37,0:09:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never get it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.57,0:09:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, hurrah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.55,0:09:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I digest you, I'll shove your\Nown crap down your measly throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.67,0:09:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.69,0:09:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stuff burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.49,0:09:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.73,0:09:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is this Mr. Jojo's grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.61,0:09:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anne, tell me what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Mr. Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.63,0:09:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true, seems he has betrayed us. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoing's face split\Nand now he's a giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.05,0:09:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.97,0:09:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoing wasn't Mr. Kakyoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:09:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a fake, Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo got attacked by some weird slime on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.33,0:10:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the cable car and now\Nit's eating his finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.61,0:10:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.13,0:10:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.27,0:10:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm at the cable car\Nstation at the train center.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.61,0:10:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's being attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.33,0:10:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyo-ing went crazy\Nand is attacking Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.31,0:10:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and come back to the\Nhotel as fast as you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did someone say my name just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.11,0:10:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.27,0:10:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.19,0:10:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo left me behind, so I\Nwas sunbathing by the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With your school uniform on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.89,0:10:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the real one here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And be careful, this means\Nyour Kakyoin is... a fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.05,0:10:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo just jumped out of the cable car!
