Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good freakin' grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stand that fuses with\Nflesh, it's devouring my finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could get bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.39,0:11:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I've gotta get this stuff off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.17,0:11:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might be easier said than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.59,0:11:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might mean I have to cut off my finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.11,0:11:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, do you really think you got away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.39,0:11:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to burst your bubble, old pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.85,0:11:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now dig that earwax out of your\Nears and listen up, hotshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.03,0:11:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your time's run out, cause yellow\Ntemperance has no weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.27,0:11:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.89,0:11:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that I don't have to chase you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.79,0:11:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll hurt like a son of a\Nbitch, but I don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.73,0:11:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flame only made it grow bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.13,0:12:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.05,0:12:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, I thought I had it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.41,0:12:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.45,0:12:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.81,0:12:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's certainly a bizarre entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.13,0:12:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.57,0:12:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.77,0:12:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need to borrow your\Npopsicle for just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.45,0:12:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.91,0:12:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it you think you're\Ndoing with that child?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.41,0:12:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this your kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he's not, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.95,0:12:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then shut up, lady, and enjoy the scenery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.23,0:12:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.15,0:12:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we get down to the bottom,\NI'll buy you a new one, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.17,0:12:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever kind you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.81,0:12:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can't burn it off...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.53,0:12:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.77,0:12:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's forming needles and\Ndigging even deeper into my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.67,0:12:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.35,0:13:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing will work on it,\Nnot even fire and ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you before, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't find a single weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.13,0:13:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now you're mine, you little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yurtha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa, the puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.43,0:13:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got our puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.71,0:13:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.99,0:13:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were already in this cable\Ncar waiting for me, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please. Don't hurt Poco!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out! Don't pull him! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.51,0:13:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now it's your turn to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.43,0:13:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gyotaro, old pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.53,0:13:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're fast, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.49,0:13:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep telling you I\Ndon't have any weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.81,0:13:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.49,0:13:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dumbass redneck!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:14:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand is armor that\Ncan also absorb power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.79,0:14:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A defensive wall that can also attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.45,0:14:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how fast you are,\Nno matter how strong or smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.71,0:14:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you are, against yellow\Ntemperance, you are helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.67,0:14:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't survive unless, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.69,0:14:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you suck it up and take a\Ncleaver to your right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.63,0:14:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.01,0:14:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try as hard as you want, but\Nyou have no way of winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.43,0:14:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting out of this,\Nnot until you're digested.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.73,0:14:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll eat you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.87,0:14:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.21,0:14:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right. You really\Ndon't have any weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.01,0:14:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you are the world's strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.03,0:14:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll tell you, we Cujos...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean Joestars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.19,0:14:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We use strategy to fight\Nour way past any obstacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't won yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I still have one\Nstrategy left. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.39,0:15:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.79,0:15:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.25,0:15:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in the middle of being\Neaten alive, you dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.47,0:15:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand's got a hole that you can't\Nescape, and you say you'll run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.93,0:15:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I said run away...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.23,0:15:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I meant into the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.65,0:15:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it! I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.07,0:15:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You let your stand's guard\Ndown to take a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.71,0:15:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stand may be invincible,\Nbut you sure as hell aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I destroy you, then\Nyour stand dies too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.97,0:15:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.23,0:15:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I've had it up to here\Nwith that Guccio mouth of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.73,0:15:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright?
