Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.25,0:16:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.07,0:16:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't fight anymore. I'm through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.47,0:16:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My beautiful nose is completely shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.33,0:16:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my face is so messed up, they're\Ngoing to have to wire my jaw shut too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.65,0:16:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts. Spare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, he paid me to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.95,0:16:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't plan on risking\Nmy life going after you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.35,0:16:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.85,0:16:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want something from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other stand users, I\Nwant all the info you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.31,0:16:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's the one thing I can't\Nsay, don't ask me that, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.61,0:16:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't do it, I mean I do have some\Npride, you know, I just can't, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well okay then, that's honorable I\Nremember now, there are four of them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One is the emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.47,0:16:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then hanged man and empress, and\Nthe last one goes by death Got it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.85,0:16:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and what about their powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.91,0:16:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, really, I honestly\Ndon't know anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.65,0:16:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:16:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stan users don't reveal their powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.93,0:17:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they did, they'd be exposing\Ntheir weaknesses outright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I do know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.41,0:17:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some witch taught Dio about stans, and her\Nson is one of the four coming after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.99,0:17:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name is Centerfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.77,0:17:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's unmistakable because\Nhe has two right hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.33,0:17:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His card is the Hanged Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.89,0:17:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one who killed Polnareff's\Nlittle sister, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard the occasional\Nrumor about his powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.99,0:17:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.31,0:17:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, he uses a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.15,0:17:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't actually seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.87,0:17:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Polnareff has no chance of winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.45,0:17:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.73,0:17:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just noticed something, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.73,0:17:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I've still\Ngot some luck on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.25,0:17:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sucks to be you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.67,0:17:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that drain over\Nthere off to your right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one with all the blue crawdads?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.27,0:17:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a real good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.69,0:18:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.77,0:18:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A manhole!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.85,0:18:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.49,0:18:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That drain pipe connects to this manhole!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.33,0:18:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect setup for\NYellow Temperance's power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.07,0:18:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna pull you in and hold you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.67,0:18:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't attack me, loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.07,0:18:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess what I told you about the man\Nwith two right hands will go to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.71,0:18:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna be able to help\Npoor Polnareff, Jotaro Kujo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.99,0:18:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't I lucky to have\Nthis drain to slurp you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.41,0:18:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you thought you had me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.11,0:18:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, am I lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.49,0:18:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to power off with some crustaceans!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.77,0:18:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll mess you up and turn you into jelly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when I kill you, Dio's gonna give\Nme a hundred million dollars! Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.95,0:19:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few minutes of brawling with\Nyou and I will be set for life!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't I lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.51,0:19:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me I'm lucky, you\Nball-less little butt-munch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.21,0:19:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're focused on everything else,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to observe yourself. You don't\Nget it, do you? Fine, then I'll just beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.37,0:19:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the lesson in your luck finally ran out\Nbefore you got away with only a broken nose
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.53,0:19:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when i'm done you won't\Nhave any bones left to break
