Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.95,0:19:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what did he just do he\Npunched me with water
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was only kidding around, Mr. Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I was just\Nmessing with you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.59,0:19:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't mean anything by it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.71,0:19:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be cool, man, be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.41,0:20:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just a prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.95,0:20:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.85,0:20:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not thinking about\Npunching me anymore, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.69,0:20:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm seriously injured here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.53,0:20:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My nose is badly broken and my jaw\Nis going to have to be wired shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.03,0:20:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.01,0:20:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have nothing more to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.59,0:20:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're way too pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done wasting my breath.
