Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.65,0:20:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.23,0:20:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're finally heading to India.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.03,0:20:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the man with the two right\Nhands is called Centerfold. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.21,0:20:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, where did Anne run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was hanging around Singapore Station\Nright before our train departed, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.81,0:20:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.89,0:21:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, she came to\NSingapore to meet her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.37,0:21:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, that story about her meeting\Nup with her dad sounded fishy to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.37,0:21:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet she's a runaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.11,0:21:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it is a bit lonely without\Nthat little rug rat, right, Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.27,0:21:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.57,0:21:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that stand earlier was pretty creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.29,0:21:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It freaks me out that a stand\Ncould disguise himself as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.85,0:21:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I've been thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.85,0:21:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have transformed\Nwhen I left the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.33,0:21:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, those cherries,\Nare you gonna eat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.03,0:21:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to be greedy, but\Nthey are my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could I have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.17,0:21:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.19,0:21:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.69,0:21:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.79,0:21:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flamingos in flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.83,0:21:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.93,0:21:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ciao, ciao.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.45,0:22:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb,\Nthey do the sand dance, don't you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.77,0:22:16.14,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.14,0:22:18.40,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.09,0:22:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.40,0:22:19.85,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.65,0:22:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.65,0:22:23.11,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.79,0:22:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the birds are men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.11,0:22:25.44,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.43,0:22:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the money on\Na bed Called crocodiles.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.44,0:22:27.78,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.78,0:22:29.28,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.09,0:22:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.95,0:22:32.41,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.07,0:22:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Falling tight to the hook, I say!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.41,0:22:34.62,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.33,0:22:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.35,0:22:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.63,0:22:44.17,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.43,0:22:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.07,0:22:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays,\Nspin around and they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.56,0:22:58.02,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.02,0:23:00.40,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.05,0:23:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.40,0:23:01.65,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.59,0:23:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then\Nthey bring you more.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.69,0:23:05.03,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.73,0:23:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.03,0:23:07.36,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.35,0:23:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like the punk and the metal band.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.36,0:23:09.70,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They like the punk and the metal band
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.43,0:23:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.70,0:23:11.16,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.65,0:23:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.99,0:23:14.33,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.67,0:23:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.33,0:23:16.54,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.45,0:23:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.67,0:23:26.76,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
