Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.97,0:23:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody's already stolen my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.65,0:23:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need any?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.81,0:23:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tip! Tip!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.43,0:23:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't give me tips,\Nyou won't go to heaven, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.89,0:23:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey kid, don't put your\Nnose all over my stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.05,0:23:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.97,0:23:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is India? See?
